[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Consequences for the error surface:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `driver` returns `void`. There is **no** error code, sentinel, `errno` write,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `assert`, `abort`, or `exit` anywhere in the library — so there are no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   error-return rows in the classic sense. Equality of "error result" is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   therefore asserted as: *both implementations return normally and emit the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   identical (possibly empty) byte stream on `stdout`*.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Both parameters are by-value `int`. There are **no pointer parameters**, so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   null-pointer rows are not applicable (there is no pointer to pass).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * There are **no `enum` types, no length/size parameters, and no arrays or
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   buffers**, so out-of-range-enum and oversized-length rows are not applicable.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   The generic-boundary obligation is instead discharged over the full `int`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   domain: `INT_MIN`, `-1`, `0`, `1`, and `INT_MAX` on each parameter, plus the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   one-step-past values around every constant the code compares against
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (`0`, `1`, `3`, `4`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The only *rejection* the C performs is the loop-entry guard
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `while (x > 0 || y > 0)`: when it is false the function returns immediately
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   having produced **no output at all**. Rows 1–6 enumerate the distinct value
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   classes that make this guard reject.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Rows 12–14 are inputs on which the C **does not terminate** (and, in doing
