[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   returns. The Rust translation reproduces the same non-terminating shape
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (`y = y.wrapping_sub(1)`), which is what the C compiler actually emits.
